tailor.resume_customizer_user_prompt_template:
Using only evidence from the supplied resume files, tailor the resume for this role. Prioritize the strongest relevant accomplishments, de-emphasize unrelated content, and rewrite selected bullets for clarity, specificity, and impact. Remove )(General) from the section headers. Preserve factual accuracy: do not invent or infer achievements, skills, responsibilities, metrics, dates, titles, certifications, or technologies. Do not copy long phrases from the job description. Return complete, valid TeX for every requested module. Use the available space effectively to produce a polished, content-rich, single-page PDF.

Job information:

{job_packet}

advisor.advisor_job_titles_user_prompt_template:
Based on the resume corpus, the job packets, and compatibility scores, recommend 3-5 job titles that best fit the resume. Keep each item short: title plus a brief fit note.

